# M / B002 — hook-io helpers, stop-co-change hook (static analysis; not executed).

C R9 OL PST-008 | SHOULD (Stop reminder; once per change state) | When Domain or persistence model files change without development seeder changes (and a seeder exists), confirm the seeded entities are unaffected or update DbSeeder. | Stop of a session with uncommitted changes | Reminder repeats only for a changed state; silent while stop_hook_active.
C R10 OL PST-010 | SHOULD (Stop reminder; once per change state) | When EF Core migration files changed, review them before committing. | Stop of a session with uncommitted changes | Reminder repeats only for a changed state.
C R11 OL TST-009,TST-010 | SHOULD (Stop reminder; once per change state) | When backend or frontend production code changed without any test change, confirm regression coverage for bug fixes and that behavioral probes are preserved as maintained tests. | Stop of a session with uncommitted changes | Reminder repeats only for a changed state.

